{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_01",
  "title": "一清二白",
  "storyCode": "OR-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a05f3ce58b97b950ee0f6829828e1588d5beaf76f7e97e07376f68ffc6cd35f3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廚房傳來的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忙著呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廚房傳來的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是的，不就是一碗素麵，算我請你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廚房傳來的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢走，再來啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老姜，點菜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來啦來啦！老劉，今天想吃什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老規矩，今天有什麼新鮮菜色啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在正是吃柿子的季節，今天還有新到的板栗，那叫一個生吃爽脆，熟食綿密香甜……那就幫您上一道桂香柿子餅、一道板栗燉腩肉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "講究。行，就聽你安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，之前幫你們店裡修的這個招牌……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，我們大廚說過的，這頓不記您的帳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些年店裡的木匠活都多虧了您照應，請您吃幾頓飯，不算什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈……厚道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說，他這手藝，的確可以稱得上天下第一了。出了這個門，別的館子都吃不到這一口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前送他那個木牌小掛飾，我可是真心的，他還害羞不肯收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎喲喲……可真是折煞人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們就是一尋常小飯館，多虧各位關照才能開下去，就別提什麼“天下第一”了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，你們小大廚人呢？今天沒見他坐在外面陪客人聊天啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別提了，今天一早就在那裡鬧彆扭呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這陣子不是有一個蠻出名的美食評論家，要藉最近百珍宴的風頭，訪遍全城不為人知的小店，還要在報刊上逐一評論打分嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道我知道，聽說她發表文章，把百灶數得上號的飯館酒樓全都評了一遍，還寫了本書，號稱要收集百灶古往今來所有優秀菜譜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像叫什麼“行箸散人”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位志氣真是不小，百灶有多少家酒樓，這些酒樓又做了多少年的菜。寫書的這位肚子裡不僅要有墨水，還要裝得下不少美食啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可不是嗎……但聽說她在寫的那本《百灶食珍錄》，那四大名樓的主廚看了都讚不絕口。她寫的評論，那些名廚也沒有不心服口服的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小道消息說，那位高人今天就要逛到我們這一片了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這又何必鬧彆扭呢？就他的手藝，再厲害的評論家還能挑出一個不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他那脾氣您又不是不知道，不管好評差評，就是聽不得別人對他的菜說三道四。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）說著不願意和別人在廚藝上爭個誰先誰後，還不是怕有人的手藝比他的更受歡迎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不說了不說了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我倒是怕這家小飯館變得廣為人知，我們這些老熟客就都排不上隊囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "借您吉言吧——哎呀，又來客人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喲，二位也是這個點才來吃飯啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這小飯館開在大理寺對門，倒是變成你們大理寺的餐廳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是為了這一口，我早就辭職回老家種地了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別亂說，我輩職責在身，辭職哪是那麼隨便的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是怎麼了，一個個的都板著張臉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還不是為了百珍宴，每年這個時候，大理寺上下都忙得要死。這一個月我就沒睡過一個好覺，這樣下去誰受得了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心一點總沒錯的……現在多少大人都齊聚百灶，出了一星半點的閃失，誰擔待得起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，就算再怎麼小心，越是這種要緊時候，麻煩事就越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸，上了飯桌不許說工作，要說也只許說能下飯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呿，搞得好像誰樂意說一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是話說回來……聽說了嗎，鼎豐樓的案子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼案子？有事說事，幹嘛搞得神神秘秘的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是我故弄玄虛，是這事，它真的邪門啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g10_restaurantkitchen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上個月十五號那天，鼎豐樓正是忙得透不過氣的時候。那一百多號灶台，從早到晚連軸轉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果到晚上的時候，有一個灶台突然起了大火，而且怎麼都撲不滅！四五個廚師都受了傷呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是源石能源管道出了故障？這算什麼新奇事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是鑑定科的調查員去現場調查過，他們也分不清那能源管道到底有沒有被人動過手腳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "進得了廚房的有幾百號人，誰知道是不是有人做了什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要知道，那鼎豐樓可是百灶第一名樓，百珍宴的承辦方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且這事怪就怪在，事發偏偏在月中十五號的晚上，那起火的又偏偏是第一百號灶台，而且有人說，分明從那火中看到了一個人影……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打住打住，說案子就說案子，不要講這些無中生有的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騙你幹嘛！現場好多人都看到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，你們大理寺的工作很刺激嘛，聽你們說起查案子簡直像是在聽說書似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有的事，我們又不是茶館裡的說書人。但凡一個案子拖了幾週沒有進展，每天晚上睡覺都會做惡夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……不過說起來，其實我這也聽說了一件奇怪的案子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有什麼怪力亂神，就是離奇又離譜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有更精彩的故事？快說來聽聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種事……實在不好隨意開口的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有話說一半的，你要急死人啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事關重大，這案件發生的地方，實在不一般——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前任禮部尚書，寧大人的府上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我師父前陣子在跟的一件案子，我也只是聽了個大概，具體的情況他對我都是三緘其口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寧大人已經退休數年，最近準備離京還鄉，搬回江南故居了。可就在幾天前，寧府遭了一個奇怪的賊人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "府上沒丟東西，也沒人受傷。但是一間客房裡掛著的一幅仙翁圖，被人用融化的蜜糖，在畫上那仙翁嘴巴上塗了一道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按理說，那寧府也算戒備森嚴，但那賊人就彷彿對寧府的布置瞭如指掌……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，那賊人不知該說是武藝高強，還是經驗豐富，現場什麼痕跡都找不到，我師父他們現在正為這案子忙得焦頭爛額呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蜜糖封口？那不是送灶神的傳說嗎？讓灶神多言好事，少說壞事……這賊人不圖錢財，偏偏來這一齣，難道別有深意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能有什麼深意？寧尚書為官清白，他在禮部幾十年的功績，朝堂上下也是有口皆碑，誰會和他過不去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，那寧尚書是朝廷重臣，他府上遭人擅闖已是足夠嚴重的事了，更何況是在最近這個節骨眼上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，怕什麼來什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了對了！我想起來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚇我一跳，你又想起什麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽你們說得熱鬧，我突然想起來，前幾天就在這飯館裡，我也撞見了一件怪事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在三天前，我在這裡吃飯的時候，店裡來了一位怪人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起來一把年紀，身上還穿著囚服，像是剛從大理寺放出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大搖大擺地在店裡坐下，什麼菜都不點，就要了二十碗白飯。好傢伙，一口氣吃了個乾乾淨淨……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客人……您就吃這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只吃米飯也噎得慌，要不幫您上兩道小菜，再來碗湯？就算送您的，不收錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用不著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這大荒城的稻米，清清白白，本來就是世上絕味，還要什麼下飯菜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我吃得舒心，不差你們的錢，夥計，結帳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那怪人吃完飯，抱著二十個空碗，從這飯館走了出去，一直走到對面大理寺門口。他把那疊碗往大理寺的門口一摔，大聲喊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“卷牘庫的火就是我放的——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉呀，看我這記性，這大理寺的事，你們肯定知道得比我清楚——那人到底是誰？這事後來怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算只是在飯桌上閒聊，這事似乎也不能說啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快別說了，鄰桌還有外人呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我剛聽她講維多利亞語來著，應該是外國遊客，聽不懂啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（純正的炎國話）老闆，點餐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g13_yuskitchen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“紅玉腐乳”、“麻辣豆腐”、“殼黃軟玉”、“文思秋菊”、“雕欄玉砌”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那客人點的……就是這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不悅的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不悅的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來踢館的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……那客人看起來很有禮貌，順著菜單就點了這幾道菜，也不像是同行來找碴……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說會不會……她就是那位寫《百灶食珍錄》的美食評論家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不悅的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪門子美食家評論別人的手藝就點五六盤豆腐？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大廚……冷靜，冷靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們店裡的情況你又不是不知道，能不能靠口碑吸引一批遊客就看這次了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您辛苦受累……這幾道菜千萬千萬不能馬虎了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠道而來的維多利亞人拿來一張椅子和兩壺酒，在兩位大理寺官員桌邊坐下。\n她很自然地為每人倒上一杯，濃郁香甜的氣息瞬間溢滿了桌面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別客氣別客氣，這酒就得大家一起喝才有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸，後來呢？那個摔碗砸門的人，後來怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位姑娘，你剛剛聽到的都只是飯桌上的閒談妄言……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "懇請姑娘萬萬不要到處宣揚……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？這種情況一般不都會有“請聽下回分解”之類的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是大理寺的官員，並非茶館說書先生……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真巧，我有一個朋友，也是大理寺的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為大理寺的人，個個都是板著張臉一絲不苟、什麼話都不好好說的樣子呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位維多利亞來的朋友……是一個人來炎國旅遊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼客氣，我有炎國名字，叫煌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "旅遊嘛……哈哈，也算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炎國話說得這麼流利的維多利亞人倒是少見，姑娘在炎國生活過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那倒是沒有，不過我也不完全算維多利亞人啦。我爸就是炎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "約法三章？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是做不到，我便無論如何也不能帶你回百灶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好，有話快說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一，小心陌生人，不要擅自進行不必要的行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你當我是三歲小孩啊？知道了，還有呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第二，絕對不要暴露自己是感染者……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這個也不用你廢話，我知道該怎麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第三……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕對，絕對不要對外人說起與你父親相關的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌，在這一系列案子裡，你是關鍵的證人，也是至關重要的線索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要你配合，也會確保你的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你爸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼沒什麼，我這趟就是來找親戚，順便旅遊，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過姑娘你趕上了個好時候。臨近百珍宴，現在正是百灶的各個飯館爭相鬥技的時候，趕在這個時候來旅遊，那是真的有口福囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的嗎？那有沒有什麼推薦的百灶特色菜，或者什麼推薦的飯館？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這你就有所不知了吧，百灶沒什麼特色菜，但“吃”本身就是百灶的特色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，怪不得城市名字裡面就有一個“灶”字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，民以食為天。百灶之所以叫百灶，是當初那一位真龍為百灶定名時，取了“照拂天下煙火”的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後來又有人提出，“食不厭精，膾不厭細”。飲食不僅是滿足口腹之欲，也是養身修心之道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每個時令有每個時令的菜，每個地區有每個地區的菜，吃到嘴裡的是天地精華，做飯也講求天人感應——這裡面學問可深著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就別騙人家外國遊客了，吃飯吃飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菜來囉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位客人……是對豆腐情有獨鍾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？這些菜名字都不一樣，竟然全都是豆腐嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不知道……炎國的豆腐有這麼多種做法啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事沒事，大家分一分，一起吃才熱鬧嘛——這個應該不違背“炎國餐桌禮儀”吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈……倒也無妨。那我們也不客氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，這道甜點也是我點的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文雅的女子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文雅的女子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g13_yuskitchen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不悅的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菜上了嗎？那人什麼反應？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……那點菜的客人沒怎麼吃，都分給鄰座的客人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不悅的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呿……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冷靜……冷靜……說不定這飯館的用餐氛圍，也是考察的一部分……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您先別急，我們靜觀其變……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說了半天，你們說的這個百珍宴，到底是什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑娘雖然說得一口流利的炎國話，但是對炎國的許多傳統還是不甚瞭解啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這百珍宴，就是每年中秋，炎國的真龍宴請百官，共議國事的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，朝廷開會，為什麼名字取得像是美食節一樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這百珍宴的由來，也算是一樁美談了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在很多年以前，當時的真龍舉辦壽宴，百官獻禮。獻上的禮物有來自炎國各地各式各樣的奇珍異寶，不一而足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是其中有一位年輕的戶部侍郎，為真龍獻上了一道菜，名叫“珍珠翡翠白玉湯”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真龍揭開蓋子一看，發現碗中不過是清水泡著幾片爛菜葉、幾粒糙米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真龍大怒，問戶部侍郎這是何意。那人答道，姜齊水患，顆粒難收，碗裡就是當地災民吃的食物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敢於仗義執言，這才是官員應該做的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過敢在真龍過生日的時候用這種方式跟真龍講話，這個人膽子也真是大啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，不過真龍沒有懲罰這位官員，反而大力表彰了他，責令文武百官效仿他敢於進諫的態度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真龍勒令削減了朝廷各項用度，著力賑濟救災，而後興修河堤，姜齊的水患因此得以解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，結果剛到第二年，就有知府有樣學樣，向真龍獻了道“福祿羹”，食材那叫一個奢華，就為向真龍稟報，自己治下城市鱗業豐收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，借宴席議國事從此變成了一項傳統，就叫“百珍宴”，定在每年中秋節舉辦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "屆時全城百姓共襄盛舉，百珍宴上流傳出來的菜單也會被各大酒樓爭相模仿，也算是與民同樂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦……炎國人對吃的還真是講究啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這家小飯館也是，看起來平平無奇，做的每道菜都這麼好吃！豆腐都能做出這麼多花樣，真了不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過這一道糕點……和我以前吃過的不一樣，味道也不如我吃過的好吃，感覺應該是不太正宗吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飯館的熟客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的大理寺官員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1630_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？怎麼都不說話了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的少年",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的少年",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是你說我做的菜味道不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
